{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_1","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"究竟一乘寶性論卷第一","sortOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_2","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"元魏天竺三藏勒那摩提譯","sortOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_3","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"[一]本教化品第一","sortOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_4","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"我今悉歸命　一切無上尊　爲聞法王藏　廣利諸羣生.","sortOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_5","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"諸佛勝妙法　謗以爲非法　愚癡無智慧　迷於邪正故.","sortOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_6","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"具足智慧人　善分別邪正　如是作論者　不違於正法.","sortOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_7","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"順三乘菩提　對三界煩惱　雖是弟子造　正取邪則捨.","sortOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_8","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"善說名句義　初中後功德　智者聞是義　不取於餘法.","sortOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_9","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"如我知佛意　堅住深正義　如實修行者　同取於佛語.","sortOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_10","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"雖無善巧言　但有真實義　彼法應受持　如取金捨石.","sortOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_11","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"妙義如真金　巧語如瓦石　依名不依義　彼人無明盲.","sortOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_12","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"依自罪業障　謗諸佛妙法　如是之人等　則爲諸佛呵.","sortOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_14","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"[一]藏本頌本缺此品各頌．","sortOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_16","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"或有取他心　謗諸佛妙法　如是之人等　則爲諸佛呵.","sortOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_17","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"爲種種供養　謗諸佛妙法　如是之人等　則爲諸佛呵.","sortOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_18","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"愚癡及我慢　樂行於小法　謗法及法師　則爲諸佛呵.","sortOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_19","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"外現威儀相　不識如來教　謗法及法師　則爲諸佛呵.","sortOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_20","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"爲求名聞故　起種種異說　謗法及法師　則爲諸佛呵.","sortOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_21","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"說乖修多羅　言是真實義　謗法及法師　則爲諸佛呵.","sortOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_22","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"求利養攝衆　誑惑無智者　謗法及法師　則爲諸佛呵.","sortOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_23","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"佛觀如是等　極惡罪衆生　慈悲心自在　爲說法除苦.","sortOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_24","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"深智大慈悲　能如是利益　我說不求利　爲正法久住。","sortOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_25","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"[一]本佛寶品第二","sortOrder":25},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_26","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"[二]佛體無前際　及無中閒際　亦復無後際　寂靜自覺知.","sortOrder":26},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_27","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"旣自覺知已　爲欲令他知　是故爲彼說　無畏常恆道.","sortOrder":27},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_29","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"[一]藏本此下寶種姓分別中如來藏品第一．","sortOrder":29},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_30","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"[二]藏本此下本論頌興釋論頌雜出不分．","sortOrder":30},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_32","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"佛能執持彼　智慧慈悲[一]刀　及妙金剛杵　割截諸苦芽.","sortOrder":32},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_33","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"摧碎諸見山　覆藏顛倒意　及一切稠林　故我今敬禮。","sortOrder":33},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_34","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"[二]本法寶品第三","sortOrder":34},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_35","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"非有亦非無　亦復非有無　亦非卽於彼　亦復不離彼.","sortOrder":35},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_36","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"不可得思量　非聞慧境界　出離言語道　內心知清淨.","sortOrder":36},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_37","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"彼真妙法日　清淨無塵垢　大智慧光明　普照諸世閒.","sortOrder":37},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_38","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"能破諸曀障　覺觀貪瞋癡　一切煩惱等　故我今敬禮。","sortOrder":38},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_39","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"[三]本僧寶品第四","sortOrder":39},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_40","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"正覺正知者　見一切衆生　清淨無有我　寂靜真實際.","sortOrder":40},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_41","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"以能知於彼　自性清淨心　見煩惱無實　故離諸煩惱.","sortOrder":41},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_42","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"無障淨智者　如實見衆生　自性清淨法　佛法[四]身境界.","sortOrder":42},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_43","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"無礙淨智眼　見諸衆生性　徧無量境界　故我今敬禮。","sortOrder":43},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_45","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"[一]原刻作力．今依釋論牒文改．","sortOrder":45},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_46","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"[二]藏本不分品．","sortOrder":46},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_47","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"[三]同上．","sortOrder":47},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_48","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"[四]原刻作僧．今依釋論牒文改．","sortOrder":48},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_50","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"問曰.依何等法有此三寶。答曰.偈言.","sortOrder":50},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_51","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"真如有雜垢　及遠離諸垢　佛無量功德　及佛所作業.","sortOrder":51},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_52","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"如是妙境界　是諸佛所知　依此妙法身　出生於三寶。","sortOrder":52},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_53","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"[一]本一切衆生有如來藏品第五","sortOrder":53},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_54","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"問曰.雲何得知一切衆生有如來藏。答曰.偈言.","sortOrder":54},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_55","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"一切衆生界　不離諸佛智　以彼淨無垢　性體不二故.","sortOrder":55},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_56","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"依一切諸佛　平等法性身　知一切衆生　皆有如來藏。","sortOrder":56},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_57","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"又復略說偈言.","sortOrder":57},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_58","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"體.及因.果.業.　相應.及以行.　時差別.徧處.　不變.無差別.","sortOrder":58},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_59","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"彼妙義次第　第一真法性　我如是略說　汝今應善知。","sortOrder":59},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_60","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"此偈明何義.偈言.","sortOrder":60},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_61","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"自性常不染　如寶空淨水　信法及般若　三昧大悲等。","sortOrder":61},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_63","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"[一]藏本不分品．","sortOrder":63},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_65","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"淨我樂常等彼岸功德果　厭苦求涅槃　欲願等諸業。","sortOrder":65},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_66","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"大海[一]器寶水　無量不可盡　如燈明觸色　性功德如是。","sortOrder":66},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_67","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"見實者說言凡夫聖人佛　衆生如來藏　真如無差別。","sortOrder":67},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_68","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"有不淨[二]雜淨　及以善淨等　如是次第說　衆生菩薩佛。","sortOrder":68},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_69","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"如空徧一切而空無分別　自性無垢心　亦徧無分別。","sortOrder":69},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_70","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"如虛空徧至體細塵不染　佛性徧衆生　諸煩惱不染．","sortOrder":70},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_71","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"如一切世閒依虛空生滅　依於無漏界　有諸根生滅．","sortOrder":71},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_72","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"[三]火不焼虛空　若焼無是處　如是老病死　不能焼佛性．","sortOrder":72},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_73","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"地依於水住水復依於風　風依於虛空　空不依地等．","sortOrder":73},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_74","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"如是陰界根住煩惱業中　諸煩惱業等　住不善思惟．","sortOrder":74},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_75","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"不善思惟行住清淨心中　自性清淨心　不住彼諸法．","sortOrder":75},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_76","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"陰入界如地煩惱業如水　不正念如風　淨心界如空.","sortOrder":76},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_78","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"[一]原刻作珍．今依麗刻改．","sortOrder":78},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_79","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"[二]原刻作有．今依麗刻改．","sortOrder":79},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_80","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"[三]原刻作人．今依麗刻改．","sortOrder":80},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_82","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"依性起邪念　念起煩惱業　依因煩惱業　能起陰界入．","sortOrder":82},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_83","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"依止於五陰　界入等諸法　有諸根生滅　如世界成壞．","sortOrder":83},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_84","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"淨心如虛空　無因復無緣　及無和合義　亦無生住滅．","sortOrder":84},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_85","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"如虛空淨心　常明無轉變　爲虛妄分別　客塵煩惱染。","sortOrder":85},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_86","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"菩薩摩呵薩　如實知佛性　不生亦不滅　又無老病等．","sortOrder":86},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_87","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"菩薩如是知　得離於生死　憐愍衆生故　示現有生滅。","sortOrder":87},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_88","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"佛身不變異　以得無盡法　衆生所歸依　以無邊際故．","sortOrder":88},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_89","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"常住不二法　以離妄分別　恆不執不作　清淨心力故。","sortOrder":89},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_90","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"法身及如來　聖諦與涅槃　功德不相離　如光不離日。","sortOrder":90},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_91","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"[一]本無量煩惱所纏品第六","sortOrder":91},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_92","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"萎華中諸佛　衆蜂中美蜜　皮糩中堅實　糞穢中真金．","sortOrder":92},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_93","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"地中珍寶藏　諸果子中芽　朽故弊壞衣　纏裹真金像．","sortOrder":93},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_95","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"[一]藏本不分品．","sortOrder":95},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_97","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"貧賤醜陋女　懷轉輪聖王　燋黑泥[一]模中　有上妙寶像．","sortOrder":97},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_98","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"衆生貪瞋癡　妄想煩惱等　塵勞諸垢中　皆有如來藏。","sortOrder":98},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_99","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"華蜂糩糞穢　地果故弊衣　貧賤女泥模　煩惱垢相似．","sortOrder":99},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_100","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"佛蜜實真金　寶芽金像王　上妙寶像等　如來藏相似。","sortOrder":100},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_101","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"問曰.華佛譬喻爲明何義。答曰．言萎華者喻諸煩惱.言諸佛者喻如來藏。偈言．","sortOrder":101},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_102","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"[二]功德莊嚴佛　住在萎華中　淨天眼者見　去華顯諸佛．","sortOrder":102},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_103","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"佛眼觀自法　徧一切衆生　下至阿鼻獄　具足如來藏．","sortOrder":103},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_104","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"自處常住際　以慈悲方便　令一切衆生　遠離諸障礙．","sortOrder":104},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_105","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"如朽故華中　有諸佛如來　天眼者見知　除去萎華果．","sortOrder":105},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_106","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"如來亦如是　見貪煩惱垢　不淨衆生中　具足如來藏．","sortOrder":106},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_107","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"以大慈悲心　憐愍世閒故　爲一切衆生　除煩惱華果。","sortOrder":107},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_108","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"問曰.蜂蜜譬喻爲明何義。答曰.言羣蜂者喻諸煩惱.言美蜜者喻如來藏。偈言.","sortOrder":108},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_110","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"[一]原刻作摸．今依釋論麗刻改．次同．","sortOrder":110},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_111","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"[二]藏本此段三頌．今譯文廣．次三段同．","sortOrder":111},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_113","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"上妙美味蜜　爲羣蜂圍繞　須者設方便　散蜂而取蜜．","sortOrder":113},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_114","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"如來亦如是　以一切智眼　見諸煩惱蜂　圍繞佛性蜜．","sortOrder":114},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_115","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"以大方便力　散彼煩惱蜂　顯出如來藏　如取蜜受用．","sortOrder":115},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_116","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"猶如百千億　那由他諸蟲　遮障微[一]妙蜜　無有能近者．","sortOrder":116},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_117","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"有智者須蜜　殺害彼諸蟲　取上美味蜜　隨意而受用．","sortOrder":117},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_118","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"無漏智如蜜　在衆生身中　煩惱如毒蟲　如來所殺害。","sortOrder":118},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_119","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"問曰.糩實譬喻爲明何義。答曰.言皮糩者喻諸煩惱.言內實者喻如來藏。偈言．","sortOrder":119},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_120","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"穀實在糩中　無人能受用　時有須用者　方便除皮糩．","sortOrder":120},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_121","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"佛見諸衆生　身有如來性　煩惱皮糩纏　不能作佛事．","sortOrder":121},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_122","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"以善方便力　令三界衆生　除煩惱皮糩　隨意作佛事．","sortOrder":122},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_123","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"如稻穀麥等　不離諸皮糩　內實未淨治　不任美食用．","sortOrder":123},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_124","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"如是如來藏　不離煩惱糩　令一切衆生　煩惱所饑渴．","sortOrder":124},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_126","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"[一]原刻作塵．今依麗刻改．","sortOrder":126},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_128","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"佛自在法王　在衆生身中　能示以愛味　除彼饑渴苦。","sortOrder":128},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_129","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"問曰.糞金譬喻爲明何義。答曰.糞穢譬喻者諸煩惱相似.真金譬喻者如來藏相似。","sortOrder":129},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_130","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"偈言．","sortOrder":130},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_131","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"[一]如人行遠路　遺金糞穢中　經百千歲住　如本不變異．","sortOrder":131},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_132","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"淨天眼見已　徧告衆人言　此中有真金　汝可取受用．","sortOrder":132},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_133","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"佛觀衆生性　沒煩惱糞中　爲欲拔濟彼　雨微妙法雨．","sortOrder":133},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_134","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"如於不淨地　漏失真金寶　諸天眼了見　衆生不能知．","sortOrder":134},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_135","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"諸天旣見已　語衆悉令知　教除垢方便　得淨真金用．","sortOrder":135},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_136","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"佛性金亦爾　墮煩惱穢中　如來觀察已　爲說清淨法。","sortOrder":136},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_137","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"問曰.地寶譬喻爲明何義。答曰.地譬喻者諸煩惱相似.寶藏譬喻者如來藏相似。偈","sortOrder":137},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_139","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"[二]譬如貧人舍　地有珍寶藏　彼人不能知　寶又不能言．","sortOrder":139},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_141","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"[一]藏本此段四頌．今譯文廣．","sortOrder":141},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_142","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"[二]藏本此段三頌．今譯文廣．次四段同．","sortOrder":142},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_144","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"衆生亦如是　於自心舍中　有不可思議　無盡法寶藏．","sortOrder":144},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_145","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"雖有此實藏　不能自覺知　以不覺知故　受生死貧苦．","sortOrder":145},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_146","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"譬如珍實藏　在彼貧人宅　人不言我貧　實不言我此．","sortOrder":146},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_147","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"如是法寶藏　在衆生心中　衆生如貧人　佛性如寶藏．","sortOrder":147},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_148","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"爲欲令衆生　得此珍寶故　彼諸佛如來　出現於世閒。","sortOrder":148},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_149","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"問曰.果芽譬喻爲明何義。答曰．果皮譬喻者諸煩惱相似.子芽譬喻者如來藏相似。","sortOrder":149},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_150","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"偈言．","sortOrder":150},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_151","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"如種種果樹　子芽不朽壞　種地中水灌　生長成大樹．","sortOrder":151},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_152","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"一切諸衆生　種種煩惱中　皆有如來性　無明皮所纏．","sortOrder":152},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_153","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"種諸善根地　生彼菩提芽　次第漸增長　成如來樹王．","sortOrder":153},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_154","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"依地水火風　空時日月緣　多羅等種內　出生大樹王．","sortOrder":154},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_155","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"一切諸衆生　皆亦復如是　煩惱果皮內　有正覺子芽．","sortOrder":155},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_157","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"依白淨等法　種種諸緣故　次第漸增長　成佛大法王。","sortOrder":157},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_158","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"問曰.衣像譬喻爲明何義。答曰．弊衣譬喻者諸煩惱相似.金像譬喻者如來藏相似。","sortOrder":158},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_159","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"偈言．","sortOrder":159},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_160","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"弊衣纏金像　在於道路中　諸天爲人說　此中有金像．","sortOrder":160},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_161","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"種種煩惱垢　纏裹如來藏　佛無障眼見　下至阿鼻獄．","sortOrder":161},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_162","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"皆有如來身　爲令彼得故　廣設諸方便　說種種妙法．","sortOrder":162},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_163","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"金像弊衣纏　墮在曠野路　有天眼者見　爲淨示衆人．","sortOrder":163},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_164","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"衆生如來藏　煩惱爛衣纏　在世閒險道　而不自覺知．","sortOrder":164},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_165","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"佛眼觀衆生　皆有如來藏　爲說種種法　令彼得解脫。","sortOrder":165},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_166","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"問曰.女王譬喻爲明何義。答曰．貧女譬喻者諸煩惱相似.歌羅邏四大中有轉輪王","sortOrder":166},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_167","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"身喻者生死歌羅邏藏中有如來藏轉輪王相似。偈言．","sortOrder":167},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_168","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"譬如孤獨女　住在貧窮舍　身懷轉輪王　而不自覺知．","sortOrder":168},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_170","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"如彼貧窮舍　三有亦如是　懷胎女人者　喻不淨衆生．","sortOrder":170},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_171","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"如彼藏中胎　衆生性亦然　內有無垢性　名爲不孤獨．","sortOrder":171},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_172","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"貧女垢衣纏　極醜陋受苦　處於孤獨舍　懷妊王重擔．","sortOrder":172},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_173","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"如是諸煩惱　染汙衆生性　受無量苦惱　無有歸依處．","sortOrder":173},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_174","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"實有歸依處　而無歸依心　不覺自身中　有如來藏故。","sortOrder":174},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_175","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"問曰.模像譬喻爲明何義。答曰.泥模譬喻者諸煩惱相似.寶像譬喻者如來藏相似。","sortOrder":175},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_176","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"偈言．","sortOrder":176},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_177","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"如人融真金　鑄在泥模中　外有燋黑泥　內有真金像．","sortOrder":177},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_178","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"彼人量已冷　除去外泥障　開模令顯現　取內真金像．","sortOrder":178},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_179","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"佛性常明淨　客塵所染汚　諸佛善觀察　除障令顯現．","sortOrder":179},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_180","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"離垢明淨像　在於泥模中　鑄師知無熱　然後去泥障．","sortOrder":180},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_181","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"如來亦如是　見衆生佛性　儼然處煩惱　如像在模中．","sortOrder":181},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_183","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"能以巧方便　善用說法椎　打破煩惱模　顯發如來藏。","sortOrder":183},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_184","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"[一]本爲何義[二]說品第七","sortOrder":184},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_185","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"問曰.餘修多羅中皆說一切空.此中何故說有真如佛性。偈言．","sortOrder":185},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_186","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"處處經中說　內外一切空　有爲法如雲　及如夢幻等．","sortOrder":186},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_187","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"此中何故說　一切諸衆生　皆有真如性　而不說空寂。","sortOrder":187},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_188","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"答曰．偈言．","sortOrder":188},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_189","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"以有怯弱心　輕慢諸衆生　執著虛妄法　謗真如實性．","sortOrder":189},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_190","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"計身有神我　爲令如是等　遠離五種過　故說有佛性。","sortOrder":190},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_191","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"[三]本身轉清淨成菩提品第八","sortOrder":191},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_192","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"淨得及遠離　自他利相應　依止深[四]快大　[五]時數如彼法。","sortOrder":192},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_193","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"初說佛菩提及得菩提方便.言偈．","sortOrder":193},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_194","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"向說佛法身　自性清淨體　爲諸煩惱垢　客塵所染汚．","sortOrder":194},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_196","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"[一]藏本不分品．","sortOrder":196},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_197","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"[二]原刻下衍法字．今依麗刻刪．","sortOrder":197},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_198","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"[三]藏本此下寶種姓分別中菩提品第二．","sortOrder":198},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_199","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"[四]原刻此二字亙倒．今依麗刻改．","sortOrder":199},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_200","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"[五]原刻此句作如彼所爲義．今依釋論牒文改．","sortOrder":200},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_202","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"譬如虛空中　離垢淨日月　爲彼厚密雲　羅網之所覆．","sortOrder":202},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_203","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"佛功德無垢　常恆及不變　不分別諸法　得無漏真智。","sortOrder":203},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_204","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"次說無垢清淨體.偈言．","sortOrder":204},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_205","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"如清淨池水　無有諸塵濁　種種雜華樹　周帀常圍繞．","sortOrder":205},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_206","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"如月離羅睺　日無雲翳等　無垢功德具　顯現卽彼體．","sortOrder":206},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_207","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"蜂王美味蜜　堅實淨真金　寶藏大果樹　無垢真金像．","sortOrder":207},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_208","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"轉輪聖王身　妙寶如來像　如是等諸法　卽是如來身。","sortOrder":208},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_209","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"次說成就自利利他.偈言．","sortOrder":209},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_210","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"無漏及徧至　不滅法與恆　清淨不變異　不退寂靜處．","sortOrder":210},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_211","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"諸佛如來身　如虛空無相　爲諸勝智者　作六根境界．","sortOrder":211},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_212","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"示現微妙色　出於妙音聲　令嗅佛戒香　嘗佛妙法味．","sortOrder":212},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_213","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"使覺三昧觸　令知深妙法　細思惟稠林　佛離虛空相。","sortOrder":213},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_215","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"次說第一義相應.偈言．","sortOrder":215},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_216","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"如空不思議　常恆及清涼　不變與寂靜　徧離諸分別．","sortOrder":216},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_217","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"一切處不著　離礙麤澀觸　亦不可見取　佛淨心無垢。","sortOrder":217},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_218","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"次說佛法身.偈言．","sortOrder":218},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_219","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"非初非中後　不破壞不二　遠離於三界　無垢無分別．","sortOrder":219},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_220","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"此甚深境界　非二乘所知　具勝三昧慧　如是人能見．","sortOrder":220},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_221","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"出過於恆沙　不思議功德　唯如來成就　不與餘人共．","sortOrder":221},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_222","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"如來妙色身　清淨無垢體　遠離諸煩惱　及一切習氣．","sortOrder":222},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_223","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"種種勝妙法　光明以爲體　令衆生解脫　常無有休息．","sortOrder":223},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_224","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"所作不思議　如摩尼寶王　能現種種形　而彼體非實．","sortOrder":224},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_225","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"爲世閒說法　示現寂靜處　教化使淳熟　授記令入道．","sortOrder":225},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_226","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"如來鏡像身　而不離本體　猶如一切色　不離於虛空。","sortOrder":226},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_228","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"次說如來常住身.偈言．","sortOrder":228},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_229","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"世尊體常住　以修無量因　衆生界不盡　慈悲心如意．","sortOrder":229},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_230","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"智成就相應　法中得自在　降伏諸魔怨　體寂靜故常。","sortOrder":230},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_231","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"次說不可思議體.偈言.","sortOrder":231},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_232","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"非言語所說　第一義諦攝　離諸覺觀地　無譬喻可說．","sortOrder":232},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_233","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"最上勝妙法　不取有涅槃　非三乘所知　唯是佛境界。","sortOrder":233},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_234","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"[一]本如來功德品第九","sortOrder":234},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_235","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"自利亦利他　第一義諦身　依彼真諦身　有此世諦體．","sortOrder":235},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_236","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"果遠離淳熟　此中具足有　六十四種法　諸功德差別。","sortOrder":236},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_237","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"略說偈言．","sortOrder":237},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_238","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"佛力金剛杵　破無智者障　如來無所畏　處衆如師子．","sortOrder":238},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_239","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"如來不共法　清淨如虛空　如彼水中月　衆生二種見。","sortOrder":239},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_241","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"[一]藏本此下寶種姓分別中功德品第三．","sortOrder":241},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_243","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"初說十力.偈言．","sortOrder":243},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_244","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"處非處果報　業及於諸根　性信至處道　離垢諸禪定．","sortOrder":244},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_245","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"憶念過去世　天眼寂靜智　如是等諸句　說名十種力。","sortOrder":245},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_246","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"[一]如金剛杵者.偈言．","sortOrder":246},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_247","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"處非處業性　衆生諸信根　種種道修地　過宿命差別．","sortOrder":247},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_248","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"天眼漏盡等　佛力金剛杵　能刺摧散[二]截　癡鎧山牆樹。","sortOrder":248},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_249","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"次說四無畏.偈言．","sortOrder":249},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_250","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"如實覺諸法　遮諸礙道障　說道得無漏　是四種無畏．","sortOrder":250},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_251","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"於所知境界　畢竟知自他　自知教他知　此非遮障道．","sortOrder":251},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_252","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"能證勝妙果　自得令他得　說自他利諦　是諸處無畏。","sortOrder":252},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_253","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"如師子王者.偈言．","sortOrder":253},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_254","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"譬如師子王　諸獸中自在　常在於山林　不怖畏諸獸．","sortOrder":254},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_256","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"[一]釋論此下名喻頌文合作一段．總在後出．","sortOrder":256},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_257","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"[二]原刻作斫．今依釋論牒文改．","sortOrder":257},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_259","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"佛人王亦爾　處於諸羣衆　不畏及善住　堅固奮迅等。","sortOrder":259},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_260","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"次說佛十八不共法.偈言．","sortOrder":260},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_261","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"佛無過無諍　無忘念等失　無不定散心　無種種諸想．","sortOrder":261},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_262","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"無作意護心　欲精進不退　念慧及解脫　知見等不退．","sortOrder":262},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_263","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"諸業智爲本　知三世無障　佛十八功德　及餘不說者．","sortOrder":263},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_264","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"佛身口無失　若他來破壞　內心無動相　非[一]住心捨心．","sortOrder":264},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_265","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"世尊欲精進　念淨智解脫　知見常不失　示現可知境．","sortOrder":265},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_266","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"一切諸業等　智爲本展轉　三世無障礙　廣大智行常．","sortOrder":266},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_267","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"是名如來體　大智慧相應　覺彼大菩提　最上勝妙法．","sortOrder":267},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_268","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"爲一切衆生　轉於大法輪　無畏勝妙法　令彼得解脫。","sortOrder":268},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_269","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"次說虛空不相應義.偈曰．","sortOrder":269},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_270","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"地水火風等彼法空中無　諸色中亦無虛空無礙法．","sortOrder":270},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_272","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"[一]原刻作作．今依釋論牒文改．","sortOrder":272},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_274","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"諸佛無障礙　猶如虛空相　如來在世閒　如地水火風．","sortOrder":274},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_275","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"而諸佛如來　所有諸功德　乃至無一法　共餘世閒有。","sortOrder":275},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_276","chapt