d":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"不護衆生.偈言．","sortOrder":355},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_356","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"天雨如車軸　澍下衝大地　雹及霹靂石　金剛暴火等．","sortOrder":356},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_357","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"不護微細蟲　山林諸果樹　草穀稻糧等　行人故不雨．","sortOrder":357},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_358","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"如來亦如是　於麤細衆生　相應諸方便　般若悲雲雨．","sortOrder":358},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_359","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"諸煩惱習氣　我邪見衆生　如是種種類　一切智不護。","sortOrder":359},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_360","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"爲滅苦火.偈言．","sortOrder":360},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_361","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"知病離苦因　取無病修藥　苦因彼滅道　知離觸修等．","sortOrder":361},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_362","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"無始世生死　彼流轉五道　五道中受樂　猶如臭爛糞．","sortOrder":362},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_364","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"寒熱惱等觸　諸苦畢竟有　爲令彼除滅　降大妙法雨．","sortOrder":364},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_365","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"知天中退苦　人中追求苦　有智者不求　人天自在樂．","sortOrder":365},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_366","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"慧者信佛語　已信者知苦　亦復知苦因　觀滅及知道。","sortOrder":366},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_367","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"[一]次說梵天譬喻.偈言．","sortOrder":367},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_368","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"梵天過去願　依諸天淨業　梵天自然現　化佛身亦爾．","sortOrder":368},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_369","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"梵宮中不動　常現於欲界　諸天見妙色　失五欲境界．","sortOrder":369},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_370","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"佛法身不動　而常現世閒　衆生見歡喜　不樂諸有樂。","sortOrder":370},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_371","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"有現不現.偈言．","sortOrder":371},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_372","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"從天退入胎　現生有父母　在家示嬰兒　習學諸伎藝．","sortOrder":372},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_373","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"戲樂及遊行　出家行苦行　現就外道學　降伏於天魔．","sortOrder":373},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_374","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"成佛轉法輪　示道入涅槃　諸薄福衆生　不能見如來。","sortOrder":374},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_375","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"[二]次說日譬喻.偈言．","sortOrder":375},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_377","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"[一]藏本梵天喻二段共五頌．今譯文廣．","sortOrder":377},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_378","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"[二]藏本日喻三段共九頌．今譯稍廣．","sortOrder":378},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_380","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"如日光初出　普照諸蓮華　有同一時開　亦有一時合．","sortOrder":380},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_381","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"佛日亦如是　照一切衆生　有智如華開　有罪而華合．","sortOrder":381},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_382","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"如日照水華　而日無分別　佛日亦如是　照而無分別。","sortOrder":382},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_383","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"次第．偈言．","sortOrder":383},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_384","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"日初出世閒　千光次第照　先照高大山　後照中下山．","sortOrder":384},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_385","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"佛日亦如是　次第照世閒　先照諸菩薩　後及餘衆生。","sortOrder":385},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_386","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"光明輪不同.偈言．","sortOrder":386},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_387","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"色智身二法　大悲身如空　徧照諸世閒　故佛不同日．","sortOrder":387},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_388","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"日不能徧照　諸國土虛空　不破無明闇　不示何知境．","sortOrder":388},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_389","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"放種種諸色　光明雲羅網　示大慈悲體　真如妙境界．","sortOrder":389},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_390","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"佛入城聚落　無眼者得眼　見佛得大利　亦滅諸惡法．","sortOrder":390},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_391","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"無明沒諸有　邪見黑闇障　如來日光照　見慧未見處。","sortOrder":391},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_393","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"[一]次說摩尼珠譬喻.偈言．","sortOrder":393},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_394","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"一時同處住　滿足所求意　摩尼寶無心　而滿衆生願．","sortOrder":394},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_395","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"自在大法王　同住於悲心　衆生種種聞　佛心無分別。","sortOrder":395},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_396","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"[二]次說響譬喻.偈言．","sortOrder":396},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_397","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"譬如諸響聲　依地而得起　自然無分別　非內非外住．","sortOrder":397},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_398","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"如來聲亦爾　依他心而起　自然無分別　非內非外住。","sortOrder":398},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_399","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"次說虛空譬喻.偈言．","sortOrder":399},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_400","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"無物不可見　無觀無依止　過眼識境界　無色不可見．","sortOrder":400},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_401","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"空中見高下　而空不如是　佛中見一切　其義亦如是。","sortOrder":401},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_402","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"[三]次說地譬喻.偈言．","sortOrder":402},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_403","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"一切諸草木　依止大地生　地無分別心　而增長成就．","sortOrder":403},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_404","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"衆生心善根　依止佛地生　佛無分別心　而增廣成就．","sortOrder":404},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_406","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"[一]藏本此段四頌．今譯文略．","sortOrder":406},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_407","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"[二]藏本響空二喻各二頌．與今譯合．","sortOrder":407},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_408","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"[三]藏本此段十頌．今譯文略．","sortOrder":408},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_410","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"佛聲猶如響　以無名字說　佛身如虛空　徧不可見常．","sortOrder":410},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_411","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"如依地諸法　一法諸妙藥　徧爲諸衆生　不限於一人．","sortOrder":411},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_412","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"依佛地諸法　白淨妙法藥　徧爲諸衆生　不限於一人。","sortOrder":412},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_413","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"[一]本校量信功德品第十一","sortOrder":413},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_414","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"佛性佛菩提　佛法及佛業　諸出世淨人　所不能思議．","sortOrder":414},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_415","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"此諸佛境界　若有能信者　得無量功德　勝一切衆生．","sortOrder":415},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_416","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"以求佛菩提　不思議果報　得無量功德　故勝諸世閒．","sortOrder":416},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_417","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"若有人能捨　摩尼諸珍寶　徧布十方界　無量佛國土．","sortOrder":417},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_418","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"爲求佛菩提　施與諸法王　是人如是施　無量恆沙劫．","sortOrder":418},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_419","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"若復有人聞　妙境界一句　聞已復能信　過施福無量．","sortOrder":419},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_420","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"若有智慧人　奉持無上戒　身口意業淨　自然常護持．","sortOrder":420},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_421","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"爲求佛菩提　如是無量劫　是人所得福　不可得思議．","sortOrder":421},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_423","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"[一]藏本此下寶種姓分別中利益品第五．","sortOrder":423},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_425","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"若復有人聞　妙境界一句　聞已復能信　過戒福無量．","sortOrder":425},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_426","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"若人入禪定　焚三界煩惱　過天行彼岸　無菩提方便．","sortOrder":426},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_427","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"若復有人聞　妙境界一句　聞已復能信　過禪福無量．","sortOrder":427},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_428","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"無慧人能捨　唯得富貴報　修持禁戒者　得生人天中．","sortOrder":428},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_429","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"修行斷諸障　非慧不能除　慧除煩惱障　亦能除智障．","sortOrder":429},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_430","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"聞法爲慧因　是故聞法勝　何况聞法已　復能生信心。","sortOrder":430},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_431","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"我此所說法　爲自心清淨　依諸如來教　修多羅相應．","sortOrder":431},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_432","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"若有智慧人　聞能信受者　我此所說法　亦爲攝彼人。","sortOrder":432},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_433","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"依燈電摩尼　日月等諸明　一切有眼者　皆能見境界．","sortOrder":433},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_434","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"依佛法光明　慧眼者能見　以法有是利　故我說此法。","sortOrder":434},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_435","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"若一切所說　有義有法句　能令修行者　遠離於三界．","sortOrder":435},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_436","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"及示寂靜法　最勝無上道　佛說是正經　餘者顛倒說。","sortOrder":436},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_438","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"雖說法句義　斷三界煩惱　無明覆慧眼　貪等垢所纏．","sortOrder":438},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_439","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"又於佛法中　取少分[一]說者　世典善言說　彼三尚可受．","sortOrder":439},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_440","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"何况諸如來　遠離煩惱垢　無漏智慧人　所說修多羅．","sortOrder":440},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_441","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"以離於諸佛　一切世閒中　更無勝智慧　如實知法者．","sortOrder":441},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_442","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"如來說了義　彼不可思議　思者是謗法　不識佛意故．","sortOrder":442},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_443","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"謗聖及壞法　此諸邪思惟　煩惱愚癡人　妄見所計故．","sortOrder":443},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_444","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"故不應執著　邪見諸垢法　以淨衣受色　垢膩不可染。","sortOrder":444},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_445","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"問曰.以何因緣有此謗法。答曰.偈言．","sortOrder":445},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_446","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"愚不信白法　邪見及憍慢　過去謗法障　執著不了義．","sortOrder":446},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_447","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"著供養恭敬　唯見於邪法　遠離善知識　親近謗法者．","sortOrder":447},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_448","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"樂著小乘法　如是等衆生　不信於大乘　故謗諸佛法。","sortOrder":448},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_449","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"智者不應畏　怨家蛇火毒　因陀羅霹靂　刀仗諸惡獸．","sortOrder":449},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_451","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"[一]原刻此二字作別說．今依麗刻改．","sortOrder":451},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_453","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"師子虎狼等　彼但能斷命　不能令人入　可畏阿鼻獄．","sortOrder":453},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_454","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"應畏謗深法　及謗法知識　決定令人入　可畏阿鼻獄．","sortOrder":454},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_455","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"雖近惡知識　惡心出佛血　及殺害父母　斷諸聖人命．","sortOrder":455},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_456","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"破壞和合僧　及斷諸善根　以繫念正法　能解脫彼處．","sortOrder":456},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_457","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"若復有餘人　誹謗甚深法　彼人無量劫　不可得解脫。","sortOrder":457},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_458","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"若人令衆生　覺信如是法　彼是我父母　亦是善知識．","sortOrder":458},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_459","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"彼人是智者　以如來滅後　迴邪見顛倒　令入正道故。","sortOrder":459},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_460","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"三寶清淨性　菩提功德業　我略說七種　與佛經相應．","sortOrder":460},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_461","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"依此諸功德　願於命終時　見無量夀佛　無邊功德身．","sortOrder":461},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_462","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"我及餘信者　旣見彼佛已　願得離垢眼　成無上菩提。","sortOrder":462},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_463","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"已說論本偈經竟。","sortOrder":463},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_301_464","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_301","text":"究竟一乘寶性論卷第一","sortOrder":464}],"overrides":{}}